,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"加入我們的社群，分享你的進度並獲取幫助","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":4,"offset":541},"end":{"line":23,"column":23,"offset":560}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":4,"offset":541},"end":{"line":23,"column":23,"offset":560}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1,"offset":538},"end":{"line":23,"column":23,"offset":560}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1,"offset":464},"end":{"line":23,"column":23,"offset":560}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"記住，每位優秀的開發者都是從第一個程式開始的。不要害怕嘗試和犯錯，這是我們學習和成長的方式！","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1,"offset":564},"end":{"line":25,"column":47,"offset":610}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1,"offset":564},"end":{"line":25,"column":47,"offset":610}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":26,"column":1,"offset":612}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\nimport { AnchorDiscriminatorCalculator } from \"../../../../components/AnchorDiscriminatorCalculator/AnchorDiscriminatorCalculator\";\r\n\r\n# 結論\r\n\r\n恭喜你！你已完成 Anchor 入門課程。現在你已經對 Anchor 的運作有了堅實的基礎，從核心概念到實際實施細節。\r\n\r\n## 你已學到的內容\r\n\r\n在這個課程中，你已掌握以下重要知識：\r\n- Anchor 框架的基本原理\r\n- 如何構建 Anchor 程式\r\n- 瞭解程式識別符\r\n- 構建安全 Solana 程式的最佳實踐\r\n\r\n## 下一步\r\n\r\n現在你已準備好開始使用 Anchor 構建你的第一個程式！鞏固知識的最佳方法是通過實踐。我們建議你：\r\n\r\n1. 前往 [挑戰部分](/zh-HK/challenges)\r\n2. 從適合初學者的練習開始\r\n3. 構建並測試你的第一個 Anchor 程式\r\n4. 加入我們的社群，分享你的進度並獲取幫助\r\n\r\n記住，每位優秀的開發者都是從第一個程式開始的。不要害怕嘗試和犯錯，這是我們學習和成長的方式！\r\n","highlightedCode":{}}